## PxD (Added by V1d)

> **Scope: Full PxD.** UI surfaces: search input (shared, REQ-001), filter panel, sort control, Smart Views sidebar, Create Smart View dialog, tag picker (inline), tag admin screen, tag deletion confirmation dialog, bulk file dialog, bulk code dialog, filtered count badges.

