### User Flow

**Primary Flow — Apply a tag to a document (edit path):**
1. Admin sees a document row in the queue; a tag chip area (or `+` tag icon) is visible on the row
2. Admin clicks the tag icon / chip — inline tag picker opens below the row
3. Tag picker shows existing practice taxonomy with search input; tags already applied to this document are checked
4. Admin selects one or more tags; picker closes on outside click or Escape
5. Tags saved immediately; document now appears in the count for each selected Smart View in the sidebar
6. `Notification variant="success"` shown: `{t('tags.applied.success')}`

**Primary Flow — Filter documents:**
1. Admin clicks "Filter" `Button variant="mono"` in toolbar — filter panel expands below toolbar
2. Admin selects any combination: Document type / Urgency / Source / Department / Date range / Tag
3. Document list re-renders; tab count badges update to filtered/total format (e.g. "7 / 9")
4. Admin clicks "Clear filters" — full list restores; badges revert to total-only

**Primary Flow — Create a Smart View (practice admin):**
1. Admin clicks `+` in Smart Views sidebar header — Create Smart View `Dialog` opens
2. Admin enters Smart View name (required), selects associated tag (required from taxonomy), optionally sets filter criteria
3. Admin clicks "Save Smart View" — new Smart View appears in sidebar for all practice users
4. Smart View shows live document count (all documents carrying that tag matching any filter criteria)

**Primary Flow — Work within a Smart View:**
1. Admin clicks a Smart View in the sidebar — queue list filters to documents matching that Smart View's tag + criteria
2. Admin can select documents with checkboxes; bulk actions (Bulk File, Bulk Code) appear in toolbar when 1+ selected
3. Bulk File: eligible/ineligible split shown → confirm → file eligible documents → per-document results shown
4. Bulk Code: SNOMED code picker → mandatory confirmation (patient list + codes) → execute → per-document results

**Exit Types:**
- Filter: "Clear filters" returns to full list; no navigation
- Tag picker: Escape or outside click closes without saving (if no change made)
- Create Smart View: Cancel button or Escape closes dialog; no Smart View created
- Bulk action: Cancel at any confirmation step; no documents actioned

