### Component Specifications

> 🚫 All components use `@emisgroup/ui-*` exclusively.

**Smart Views Sidebar:**
- Container: `<nav aria-label={t('smartViews.region')}>` 212px wide; collapsible to 44px via `Button variant="mono" circular` toggle
- Collapsed: icon-only strip showing toggle button; Smart View names hidden; counts hidden
- Header: `<h2>` `{t('smartViews.heading')}` + `Button variant="mono" size="small" ariaLabel={t('smartViews.create')}` (the `+` button)
- Smart View entry: `<button>` full-width; name (bold 13px) + live count `Count` badge; `aria-current="page"` when active
- Active entry: `border-left: 3px solid var(--primary)`; background `var(--hover)`
- Toggle: `Button variant="mono" circular ariaLabel={t('smartViews.toggle')} aria-expanded={isExpanded}`

**Tag Chip on Document Row:**
- Applied tag: `Tag` (or `Pill`) component with label + `×` remove button; `var(--primary)` tint
- Add tag button: `Button variant="mono" size="small" circular ariaLabel={t('tags.addTag')}` with icon `~icons/ic/outline-add` 20px
- Visibility: tag chips always visible on row; `+` button visible on row hover/focus

**Inline Tag Picker (Popover):**
- Container: `Popover` anchored to the `+` button; `role="dialog" aria-label={t('tags.picker.label')}`
- Search: `Input clearable aria-label={t('tags.picker.search')} placeholder={t('tags.picker.placeholder')}` at top
- Tag list: `<ul role="listbox">` of `<li role="option" aria-selected={isChecked}>` with `Checkbox` for each tag
- Applied tags pre-checked; click toggles; saves on picker close (outside click / Escape)
- Empty state (no tags match search): `{t('tags.picker.noResults')}`
- Keyboard: Tab into picker; Up/Down navigate; Space toggles; Escape closes and returns focus to `+` button

**Filter Panel:**
- Container: collapsible `<div>` below toolbar; toggled by Filter `Button variant="mono"`
- Filters: `Select` components for Document type, Urgency, Source, Department, Tag
- Date range: two `DatePicker` components (from/to)
- All inputs: `aria-label={t('filter.{field}.label')}`
- Clear filters: `Button variant="mono"` `{t('filter.clear')}`
- Active filter indicator: Filter button shows `Count` badge with number of active filters

**Filtered Tab Badge:**
- When filter active: `<Tabs.Tab>{t('inbox.tab.filing')} <Count aria-label={t('inbox.tab.filingFiltered', { filtered, total })}>{filtered} / {total}</Count></Tabs.Tab>`
- When no filter: `<Count>{total}</Count>` only

**Create Smart View Dialog:**
- Component: `Dialog preventBackdropClose`
- `Dialog.Header`: `{t('smartViews.create.heading')}`
- `Dialog.Description`: `{t('smartViews.create.description')}` — explains that all practice users will see this view
- Name: `Input aria-label={t('smartViews.create.name')} invalid={attempted && !name}`
- Associated tag: `Select aria-label={t('smartViews.create.tag')} invalid={attempted && !tag}` — required; lists practice taxonomy
- Info note: static text explaining documents with this tag appear in the view
- Filter criteria: same `Select` / `DatePicker` components as filter panel (all optional)
- Footer: `Button variant="mono"` Cancel + `Button variant="filled" disabled={!name || !tag}` Save Smart View

**Tag Admin Screen (accessible via `🏷 Tags` toolbar button):**
- Dedicated screen (navigate to); back link returns to Filing Queue
- Heading: `{t('tagAdmin.heading')}`
- Search + sort controls (A-Z / Z-A): `Input aria-label={t('tagAdmin.search')}` + `Select aria-label={t('tagAdmin.sort')}`
- Tag capacity warning: `Banner variant="warning"` shown when ≥80% of configured max reached
- Tag list: each row shows tag name (bold) + usage count (documents currently carrying tag, 12px `var(--text-dim)`) + Edit + Delete buttons
- Edit: inline `Input` replaces tag name; Save / Cancel buttons
- Delete: opens tag deletion confirmation `Dialog`
- Create new tag: `Button variant="filled"` `{t('tagAdmin.create')}` opens inline form at top of list

**Tag Deletion Confirmation Dialog:**
- Component: `Dialog preventBackdropClose`
- Warning copy (3 points, from AC): tag removed from taxonomy; removed from all N documents; all Smart Views using this tag deleted for all users
- Confirm: `Button variant="danger"` disabled until admin types tag name to confirm (prevents accidental deletion)
- Cancel: `Button variant="mono"`

